91` for 2025\n   - The statement header says \"As of December 31, 2025, 2024 and 2023\" and \"(In thousands of US dollars)\"\n\nThe requested field is:\n- canonical_name: \"Assets\"\n- definition: \"Total assets explicitly reported on the consolidated primary balance sheet.\"\n- period_kind: \"instant\"\n- required_scope: \"consolidated\"\n- target_end: \"2025-12-31\"\n\nThe best match is the consolidated statements of financial position (the primary balance sheet), where \"Total assets\" is explicitly reported as $7,193,091 thousand as of December 31, 2025.\n\nLet me check the details:\n- Value: 7,193,091 (the printed number)\n- Scale: The statement says \"(In thousands of US dollars)\" so scale = 1000\n- Unit: USD\n- Currency: USD\n- Period: instant, end 2025-12-31, start null\n- Accounting basis: IFRS\n- Consolidation scope: consolidated\n- Source label: \"Total assets\"\n- Location: The table T:A:638, row \"Total assets\", column \"2025\"\n\nThe evidence quote should contain the statement context and value. Let me construct it:\n\n\"Consolidated statements of financial position ... Total assets ... $ 7,193,091\"\n\nThe row in T:A:638:\n```\n<S:A:C638.24.1>Total assets  |  |  |  |  |  | <S:A:C638.24.7>$  | <S:A:C638.24.8><S:A:A:ixv-64823;n=ifrs-full:Assets;ctx=PAsOn12_31_2025;u=Unit_USD;s=3;d=-3>7,193,091  |  |  |  | <S:A:C638.24.12><S:A:A:ixv-64824;n=ifrs-full:Assets;ctx=PAsOn12_31_2024;u=Unit_USD;s=3;d=-3>6,383,565  |  |  |  | <S:A:C638.24.16><S:A:A:ixv-64825;n=ifrs-full:Assets;ctx=PAsOn12_31_2023;u=Unit_USD;s=3;d=-3>6,091,762  |  |\n```\n\nSo the value is 7,193,091 in the 2025 column, tagged with ifrs-full:Assets, ctx=PAsOn12_31_2025, unit USD, scale s=3 (thousands).\n\nThe statement is titled \"Consolidated statements of financial position\" with \"As of December 31, 2025, 2024 and 2023\" and \"(In thousands of US dollars)\".\n\nThe value pattern check: \"7193091\" matches `^-?(0|[1-9][0-9]*)(\\.[0-9]+)?$`. Yes.\n\nScale: \"1000\" - the statement is in thousa