atements in Item 18 and the contents page). This strongly suggests the anchor exists pointing at the consolidated statements of financial position. I'll use it.\n\nThe evidence quote — I should quote the text as it appears. The cell shows \"$\" then \"7,193,091\". Let me quote: \"Total assets | $ 7,193,091\" with context of the statement header. My quote is fine.\n\nDouble-check the value pattern: \"7193091\" — matches ^-?(0|[1-9][0-9]*)(\\.[0-9]+)?$. Yes.\n\nOne more consideration: should the accounting basis be IFRS? Yes — the financial statements are prepared per IFRS as issued by IASB, confirmed in the notes and the audit opinion. The enum only has US-GAAP and IFRS.\n\nConsolidation scope: \"consolidated\" — the statements are the consolidated statements of financial position of Grupo Aeroméxico, S.A.B. de C.V. and subsidiaries.\n\nDone. Output the JSON.","tools":null},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":506166,"total_tokens":509684,"completion_tokens":3518,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":3201},"output_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":3201}}}